OL,3,GNEWSAScotland's 'Chernobyl' housing
OL,4,Ascheme takes starring role in new
OL,5,Ahorror film
OL,6,
OL,7,FA short film has captured some of the
OL,8,Flast images of a derelict housing
OL,9,Festate nicknamed "Scotland's Chernobyl"
OL,10,Fbefore demolition crews moved in.
OL,12,FThe tenements at Clune Park in Port
OL,13,FGlasgow were built a century ago as
OL,14,Fhousing for shipyard workers but most
OL,15,Fof the buildings lay empty for years.
OL,17,FGlasgow-based filmmaker Alessio
OL,18,FAvezzano shot scenes for his
OL,19,Fpost-apocalyptic sci-fi horror comedy,
OL,20,FBehind, on the estate before bulldozers
OL,21,Fmoved in last May.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
