OL,3,GNEWSAScotland's 'Chernobyl' housing
OL,4,Ascheme takes starring role in new
OL,5,Ahorror film
OL,6,
OL,7,F"It's the last film to be made there.
OL,8,FIt was announced it would be demolished
OL,9,Fthe day we were filming - we managed to
OL,10,Fget in there not a moment too soon,"
OL,11,Fsaid the Scottish-Italian writer and
OL,12,Fdirector.
